Description
                    
                    
Cafe Brew, a smart coffee shop, wants to enhance its order management system. Your task is to develop a system that allows storing multiple coffee orders and provides the ability to filter orders based on a given coffee type and a minimum cup size.

Functional Requirement:

    
        
            
                Req. #
            
            
                 Type (Class)
            
            
                Requirement Description  
            
            
